{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vqURio3Wbo1795324710.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>完善選舉制度後，第二屆選委會界別分組選舉正在投票。</p><p></p><p>截至中午12時，有4,740人投票，投票率百分之83.03，比上屆同時段高約37個百分點。</p><p></p><p>其中商界(第三)，投票率達百分百，是各組別中最高。投票率暫時最低的是社會福利界，只有百分之53.37。</p><p></p><p>選管會主席陸啟康表示，投票過程暢順，有信心在合理時間內完成點票。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T06:03:43.426582+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T04:43:19.897627+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T05:57:12.703011+00:00","content_hash":"e929999eff5907f9482f035ced6b5e3c6d1000c186247112590de3739a27a833","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T06:03:43.426582+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}